---

### 2. `backend/.gitignore` (Node.js + Express)

Salin ini ke dalam file bernama `.gitignore` di dalam folder `backend` Anda.

```plaintext:backend/.gitignore:backend/.gitignore
# Dependencies
/node_modules

# Environment variables
# SANGAT PENTING! Berisi password database dan JWT secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Log files
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.log

# IDE/OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
```eof

